        <mxCell id="br" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" value="Business Rules&#xa;&#xa;1. Accounts must be approved before participation.&#xa;2. Teams contain 3 to 5 members.&#xa;3. Teams register for one Track within an Event.&#xa;4. Judges may access only assigned Rounds and Tracks.&#xa;5. Guest Judge accounts are temporary and assignment-scoped.&#xa;6. Each Judge&#39;s per-criterion scores are stored separately.&#xa;7. Score revisions, disqualifications, and result publication are recorded in the Audit Log.&#xa;8. Promotion follows the configured Top-N rule.&#xa;9. Research exports must anonymize Judge and participant identities.&#xa;10. AI assistance is optional and advisory only." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="470" x="40" y="1080" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
